WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.762
Start on a fresh practice project. Press A, Sixteen Level, then the data dial to create your first clip.

2
00:00:07.826 --> 00:00:16.222
Hold Shift and hit pad one to select the kick. Release Shift. Now the pads enter steps instead of changing sounds.

3
00:00:16.222 --> 00:00:23.114
Time runs from the top row down. Pads thirteen, nine, five, and one give us four steady kicks.

4
00:00:23.114 --> 00:00:29.483
Shift and pad two selects the snare. Release Shift, then hit pads nine and one. There's your backbeat.

5
00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:33.702
Press Play Start. Simple, but it already gives us something to build on.

6
00:00:33.702 --> 00:00:39.623
Press Stop and wait for Saved. On the Live, look for Saved on stick before restarting or switching off.
